& [Implementation]
  + ScriptedDiscoveryInspectionWitness composes three already bounded operations as bootstrap discovery pinned rediscovery and exact compact inspection
  + bootstrap begins without a caller root or handle and returns one deterministic digest-ordered candidate
  + pinned rediscovery supplies the returned root and complete checkpoint-digest prefix and must recover the identical handle and entry digest
  + inspection supplies that exact root and handle to custody and must return matching phase next-operation position terminal and digest metadata
  + workflow digest commits the ordered requests responses body denials capability denials and nonclaims
  + witness-scripted-discovery-inspection emits one normalized checked JSON artifact without accepting additional arguments

& [IdentityBoundary]
  + deterministic first-handle selection is fixture policy and not lexical semantic weighted causal or authority relevance
  + workflow validates provider-free protocol composition and not live model tool selection reflection understanding or truth
  + workflow digest is an integrity commitment and not authentication authorization provenance or source accuracy
  + the witness contains compact metadata but no checkpoint request response message or transport body

& [FacultyBehavior]
  + Honesty preserves the distinction between structural identity and semantic applicability
  + Security requires exact compiled root handle entry digest stage order and body exclusions
  + Planner fixes the dependency order bootstrap then pin then inspect
  + Weaver carries only verified identities between stages
  + Scribe records each typed request response and the enclosing workflow digest
  + Refiner prevents complete custody and provider-shaped bodies from entering the compact surface
  + Observer independently validates every stage and cross-stage equality before admitting the witness

& [Adversarial]
  + wrong workflow digest pinned flag body claim root handle entry or inspection identity refuses
  + unknown JSON fields malformed stage shapes and extra CLI arguments refuse
  + repeated generation serialization CLI stdout and checked artifact remain byte-identical

& [Rollback]
  + the module command export artifact and focused test are additive and isolated
  + P0 through Slice8A and the historical Slice7E provider-free release root remain unchanged

& [Deferred]
  + semantic anchor catalogue weighted association learned routing live provider persistence remote hidden-state effects FPGA and Minecraft remain unimplemented and unactivated
